  "Title": "精神修行",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1030214001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那就先从一分钟开始。/n闭上嘴，闭上眼，正坐着试试看。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1470",
      "BgmFileName": "19",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哼，这点程度就能练出来的话，我也不用这么辛苦了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140020",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 76,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 30301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哦？那你就试试看。/n看看你能不能一动不动，好好坚持打坐。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（……卡米拉这家伙，还说什么打坐。/n　不就是坐着吗，这到底有什么意义？）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140040",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 104,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "SpineId": 30301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "啧……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140050",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 76,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（浪费时间。相信她的我真是个笨蛋……）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140060",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 104,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "（我可没工夫坐这儿发呆。/n　既然这样，就趁和尚不注意——）",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140070",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 76,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "喝！",
      "SeFileName": "1980",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "哎呀！？好痛！？你干什么！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140090",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 300,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 2,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 30301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "连一分钟都坚持不了啊。/n看来你这孩子心浮气躁得很。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "重要公演之前，你让我什么都不干光坐着！？/n这让我怎么静得下心！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140110",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 300,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 30301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "年轻啊。这样的青涩我倒不讨厌。/n不过，你没听过「欲速则不达」吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "越焦急，越要坐稳脚跟、放宽眼界。/n虽说是句老话，却正中要害。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我可是忙得要死的现代人！/n追眼前的利益有什么错！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140140",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 300,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 14,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 30301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那我问你——",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "为什么宁可挤掉重要的排练时间，也要特地跑来这里？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "只是想不到别的办法。/n可惜这一趟算是白跑了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140170",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 76,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 30301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你原本觉得，或许能从打坐里抓住什么吧。/n这正说明你想改变自己。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "焦躁感能成为让人成长的契机，却也会让人的视野变窄。/n越是着急，越该停下脚步，重新审视自己。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "王雪",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "可、可恶，真磨蹭！你到底想说什么！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140200",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 104,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 3,
          "SpineId": 30301,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "303"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "也就是说——",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "和尚",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "现在离三天打鱼两天晒网还早得很呢。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1071",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "203",
      "SceneCameraMasterId": 10,
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.800000011920929,
      "FadeValue2": -1.5,
      "FadeValue3": 0.800000011920929
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "果然从这里经过了。跟我猜的一样。",
      "SceneCameraMasterId": 6,
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "为什么你会在这里啊……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "卡特莉娜每天跑完步之后，都会去洗澡冲汗。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "再把常泡天狼星浴场的莉莉亚提供的证词/n和你的生活圈一对照……Bingo！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你倒是说得很帅，可做的事不就是跟踪吗……。/n别干这种蠢事了，好好专心准备下一场公演。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不知怎么的，好像被大家的气势感染了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140280",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过一看到你的脸，我就恢复精神了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……我可完全看不出你像精神很好的人。/n想让我陪你，就说得高明一点。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "卡特莉娜，你……！/n果然人生还是该有一位相识已久的盟友——",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "烦死人了！快点把话说完！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1071",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 3,
      "CharacterMotions": []
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "……是《银河铁道之夜》吧，很厉害嘛。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140330",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 102,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 10303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我记得，是扎内利和——",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140331",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "「捕鸟人」……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140340",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 112,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "卡特莉娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "一脸闷闷不乐。是一人分饰两角太难了吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140350",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 10303,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "103"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "嗯。毕竟是个很难理解的角色。/n别说抓鸟了，简直像是在抓云一样虚无缥缈。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140360",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 105,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 17,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 30201,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你能理解吗？/n他靠捕捉「吃起来像点心的鸟」谋生。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140370",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 100,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 21,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 1,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "当然，根本不存在那样的鸟。完全就是幻想。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140380",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 74,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 3,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
          "CharacterLayerType": 1,
          "SpineSize": 2
        }
      ],
      "SpeakerIconId": "302"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1030214042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1030214,
      "Order": 2,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "拉莫娜",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "而且我连作品安排这个角色的意图都读不出来。太晦涩了……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10302140381",
      "CharacterMotions": [
        {
          "slotNumber": 1,
          "FacialExpressionMasterId": 104,
          "BodyMotionMasterId": 7,
          "LipSyncMasterId": 4,
          "SpineId": 0,
          "CharacterAppearanceType": 0,
          "CharacterPosition": 3,
